|author=Chris Buckley
|title=‘Vicious’ Killer of 11 Women Gets Death Penalty in China
|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20180331003833/https://www.nytimes.com/2018/03/30/world/asia/death-sentence-in-china-11-killings-.html
